      "text": "这里的沙子真白！",
      "reading": "Zhèlǐ de shāzi zhēn bái!"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "a",
      "text": "外面太热了，我们回房间休息吧。",
      "reading": "Wàimiàn tài rè le, wǒmen huí fángjiān xiūxi ba."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "好，晚上再出去！",
      "reading": "Hǎo, wǎnshang zài chūqù!"
